 --> 01:33:16.280 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这就是诺里斯的水准\n他把抓地力用到了极限\n\n900000602\n01:33:16.300 --> 01:33:19.240 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n前方两位冠军都为胜利全力以赴\n\n900000603\n01:33:21.340 --> 01:33:24.280 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n安东内利一定深深感受到了压力\n\n900000604\n01:33:24.280 --> 01:33:29.080 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n下一圈能否建立胎温非常关键\n\n900000605\n01:33:30.040 --> 01:33:32.240 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n切到林德布拉德这边\n简直像在看椭圆赛道比赛\n\n900000606\n01:33:32.260 --> 01:33:37.180 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他追着阿尔本\n阿尔本追着拉塞尔 林德布拉德正在找机会\n\n900000607\n01:33:37.200 --> 01:33:41.360 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n看看领先之争 再看看第10位这边\n两车靠得很近 但没撞上\n\n900000608\n01:33:42.000 --> 01:33:43.360 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这圈第2赛段 胎面温度应该就上来\n\n900000609\n01:33:44.180 --> 01:33:46.440 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不 伙计 是悬架的问题\n\n900000610\n01:33:47.180 --> 01:33:48.180 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好 等一下\n\n900000611\n01:33:49.380 --> 01:33:51.120 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他眼下还能继续跑\n\n900000612\n01:33:51.180 --> 01:33:57.440 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n到了4号弯\n诺里斯这一下很惊险 安东内利暂时撑住了\n\n900000613\n01:33:57.440 --> 01:34:01.360 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n皮特·邦宁顿说只是胎温问题\n这似乎也是最明显的解释\n","095":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n900000613\n01:33:57.440 --> 01:34:01.360 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n皮特·邦宁顿说只是胎温问题\n这似乎也是最明显的解释\n\n900000614\n01:34:01.380 --> 01:34:07.020 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他没有撞到东西 还稍微拉开了优势\n\n900000615\n01:34:07.360 --> 01:34:09.143 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n林德布拉德和阿尔本却险些接触\n\n900000616\n01:34:09.143 --> 01:34:10.840 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n刚才看到了阿尔本的前翼\n\n900000617\n01:34:11.460 --> 01:34:14.300 align:middle line: